---
// Post 12 (Backtest) figure: Purge. Inline SVG, site tokens only, no ids. Numbers come from the Python runs recorded in the post brief.
---
<figure class="atp12-purge">
  <div class="atp12-purge-scroll">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 900 296" role="img" aria-label="A timeline with a training block, a purge zone, a test block, an embargo zone and another training block. Below, on pure noise, a shuffled 5-fold test shows a correlation of 0.94 between prediction and label while purged blocks with an embargo show minus 0.01.">
<text x="20" y="28" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>Overlapping labels leak across the cut</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Nhãn chồng lấn rò rỉ qua đường cắt</tspan></text>
<rect x="40" y="60" width="260" height="40" rx="6" class="box" />
<text x="170" y="85" class="t13" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>train</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>huấn luyện</tspan></text>
<rect x="300" y="60" width="70" height="40" rx="6" class="badb" />
<text x="335" y="85" class="t13" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>purge</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>loại bỏ</tspan></text>
<rect x="370" y="60" width="190" height="40" rx="6" class="okb" />
<text x="465" y="85" class="t13 b" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>test block</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>khối kiểm tra</tspan></text>
<rect x="560" y="60" width="70" height="40" rx="6" class="badb" />
<text x="595" y="85" class="t13" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>embargo</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>cách ly</tspan></text>
<rect x="630" y="60" width="230" height="40" rx="6" class="box" />
<text x="745" y="85" class="t13" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>train</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>huấn luyện</tspan></text>
<path d="M 340 112 L 340 124 L 410 124 L 410 112" class="redl" />
<text x="30" y="146" class="t13"><tspan data-lang-en>A day inside the purge zone has a 20-day label: the label already contains the first days of the test block.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Một ngày nằm trong vùng loại bỏ có nhãn 20 ngày: nhãn đó đã chứa những ngày đầu của khối kiểm tra.</tspan></text>
<text x="20" y="190" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>Correlation between predicted and true label, on pure noise (the true answer is zero)</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Tương quan giữa nhãn dự đoán và nhãn thật, trên nhiễu thuần (đáp án đúng là 0)</tspan></text>
<text x="300" y="222" text-anchor="end"><tspan data-lang-en>Shuffled 5-fold</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>K-fold xáo trộn</tspan></text>
<rect x="316" y="204" width="470.0" height="26" rx="3" class="redf" />
<text x="796.0" y="223" class="b">0.94</text>
<text x="300" y="266" text-anchor="end"><tspan data-lang-en>Purged blocks + embargo</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Khối có loại bỏ + cách ly</tspan></text>
<rect x="316" y="248" width="4" height="26" class="goldf" />
<text x="330" y="267" class="b">−0.01</text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Simulated data: 2,520 days of random returns, label = the next 20 days' return, predictor = the mean label of the 10 nearest training days (seed 3). Any correlation above zero here is leakage.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Số liệu mô phỏng: 2.520 ngày lợi suất ngẫu nhiên, nhãn = lợi suất 20 ngày kế tiếp, bộ dự đoán = nhãn trung bình của 10 ngày huấn luyện gần nhất (seed 3). Tương quan nào lớn hơn 0 ở đây đều là rò rỉ.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .atp12-purge { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .atp12-purge-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .atp12-purge svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .atp12-purge text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .atp12-purge .h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .atp12-purge .s { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .atp12-purge .t13 { font-size: 13px; }
  .atp12-purge .b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .atp12-purge .redt { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .atp12-purge .goldt { fill: var(--gold-icon); font-weight: 700; }
  .atp12-purge .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); }
  .atp12-purge .okb { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold); }
  .atp12-purge .badb { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); }
  .atp12-purge .ln { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; fill: none; }
  .atp12-purge .arrf { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .atp12-purge .ax { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; fill: none; }
  .atp12-purge .grid { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; stroke-dasharray: 3 4; fill: none; }
  .atp12-purge .redl { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2; fill: none; }
  .atp12-purge .goldl { stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 2; fill: none; }
  .atp12-purge .mutl { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; stroke-dasharray: 5 4; fill: none; }
  .atp12-purge .redf { fill: var(--red); }
  .atp12-purge .goldf { fill: var(--gold); }
  .atp12-purge .mutf { fill: var(--text-faint); }
  .atp12-purge .hole { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .atp12-purge figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
